{"publicId":"a0c8e647-3a05-4a4e-b512-ec278ab718ba","title":"佛罗里达大学研究揭示猫蓝眼基因与听力损失关联","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T22:20:06.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-16T22:20:06.000Z","digest":"佛罗里达大学Olga Shatokhina团队在《Companion Animal Health and Genetics》发表综述，系统梳理了8种与猫蓝色眼睛相关的基因变异（含PAX3、DBE CEL/ALT/AGO等），并首次将其中4种变异数据与听力损失关联。\n\n研究指出这些基因变异存在独立遗传来源，但均可能导致单双蓝眼且白点较少的表型。其中DBE基因存在不完全外显现象，部分携带者不表现蓝眼特征。\n\n特别发现DBE RE杂合体与听力损失存在关联（证据来源：该团队研究），而DBE RE纯合体则被预测会导致胚胎致死（该团队研究）。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T01:33:14.035Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"佛罗里达大学 Olga Shatokhina 等发表猫蓝色眼睛基因研究扩展","latestReport":{"id":"v8guz6ugm45960macnlfqtrhx"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fH355GKyY42Q","title":"研究猫蓝眼基因遗传及其健康影响","firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T22:20:06.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"v8guz6ugm45960macnlfqtrhx","title":"佛罗里达大学 Olga Shatokhina 等发表猫蓝色眼睛基因研究扩展","summary":"佛罗里达大学 Olga Shatokhina 等在《Companion Animal Health and Genetics》发表综述，系统梳理了8种与猫蓝色眼睛相关的基因变异（含PAX3、DBE CEL/ALT/AGO等），并首次将其中4种变异数据与听力损失关联。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T22:20:06.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"v8guz6ugm45960macnlfqtrhx","title":"佛罗里达大学 Olga Shatokhina 等发表猫蓝色眼睛基因研究扩展","summary":"佛罗里达大学 Olga Shatokhina 等在《Companion Animal Health and Genetics》发表综述，系统梳理了8种与猫蓝色眼睛相关的基因变异（含PAX3、DBE CEL/ALT/AGO等），并首次将其中4种变异数据与听力损失关联。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T22:20:06.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T02:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T03:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T04:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T05:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T06:00:00.000Z","heat":8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T07:00:00.000Z","heat"